========================================================================
This is an original implementation of Phonation Onset Time (POT) for
Vocaliscope. Algorithm based on standard definitions in voice literature:
Chacon, A. et al. (2024). "Voice Onset Measures: A Systematic Review".
PLOS ONE, 19(3), e0301234. DOI: 10.1371/journal.pone.0301234
